# passages/00031-Changes.mws.yaml
Changes_001=A Return to Civility
Changes_002=Though the decayed trails that led to the village caused a carriage to jostle and creak most violently, a brisk, morning ride allowed the aging aristocrats a chance to escape the stale air of their stone manors and ruminate on the melancholic, dour beauty of the region.
Changes_003=It was upon these morning rides that they were able to observe a sudden and peculiar transformation occurring within the town. Crews of hired laborers arrived to clear several of the empty lots in the village and construct new foundations. Within weeks, these vacant lots were filled by nondescript buildings of various purposes.
Changes_004=Armed with an inimitable curiosity and thirst for knowledge, the cousins could not resist further investigation.
Changes_005=All players discard their Letter cards to the box.

