Envelopes_002=**Secret Meeting**
Envelopes_003=When I arrived at the location, I went about my business as normal. As I was leaving, I felt a gentle tap on my shoulder. A woman dressed in traditional garb tipped her wool cap and bid me follow her to a wooden bench nearby.

