InfinityClick2_006=immaculate brain
InfinityClick2_007=inestimable mind
InfinityClick2_008=I have surely unlocked a most flawless scheme to extend my existence indefinitely!
InfinityClick2_009=the world will tremble at the mere utterance of my name.
InfinityClick2_010=infinite
InfinityClick2_011=future
InfinityClick2_012=There is no doubt in my {_rnd_InfinityClick2_1}. With this research completed, {_rnd_InfinityClick2_2} The ravages of time will no longer have an effect on my work and I will be free to face the {_rnd_InfinityClick2_3} unimpeded by this mortal coil!
InfinityClick2_013=Retrieve the **Immortality cards** from the scenario box. Shuffle them face down and place them nearby.
InfinityClick2_014=**Draw 2 Immortality cards. Look at both of them and choose one as your secret to Eternal Life. Discard the other.** Then, discard the {icon:storybook} token to the supply.

# passages/00096-InfinityClick1.mws.yaml
InfinityClick1_001=Research Completed
InfinityClick1_002=It seemed unimaginable; not simply a cure for all disease, but a mysterious contrivance to extend life indefinitely. Perhaps, those that pursued this heretical course of action should not have postulated, "could it be done?" Instead, they might have asked themselves, "but at what cost?"
InfinityClick1_003=**Which player has completed the third level of their Journal's Research Track?**
InfinityClick1_004=Dr. {nameA}
