# passages/00111-BuildingSignin.mws.yaml
BuildingSignin_001=Investigation
BuildingSignin_002=After visiting the establishment, the peculiar attitude of the workers and the pristine furnishings further piqued their curiosity. Several days later, they decided to forgo their scientific obligations for one evening and investigate the {inv}.
BuildingSignin_003=**Please choose which player is making this investigation:**

# passages/00112-BuildplayA.mws.yaml
BuildplayA_002=**Continuing Investigation - Compiled Journal Entries of {nameA}**
BuildplayA_005=To my chagrin, a {_rnd_BuildplayA_0} stood near the front door of the building. At this late hour, I could only assume that they were standing guard. Not to be thwarted so easily, I tilted my hat to obscure my face and stalked into the alley behind. The lock on the rear door was a trifle for my tools, and I entered without a sound.

# passages/00113-ExposeConfirmation.mws.yaml
ExposeConfirmation_001=Exposed
ExposeConfirmation_002=I knew it was the correct decision. To allow this terrible work to continue unabated would not align with my own crucial endeavors. But, would my cousins feel the same way?

# passages/00114-ConcealConfirmation.mws.yaml
ConcealConfirmation_001=Concealed
ConcealConfirmation_002=Knowledge may have been my main pursuit when investigating the suspicious building, but now with a complete understanding of the devious machinations inside, I decided to err on the side of secrecy. But would this be enough?

