# passages/00134-NewMaster2A.mws.yaml
NewMaster2A_002=With my unique {disA} skills, this creation was already more focused and impressive than ever before. But, what ingenious type of creation would I explore?

# passages/00135-NewMaster3A.mws.yaml
NewMaster3A_016=**The {_rnd_NewMaster3A_0} {creationA}**

# passages/00136-NewMaster.mws.yaml
NewMaster_001=Masters of Their Own Destiny
NewMaster_002=It seemed the pervasive gloom of {townname} had infected the halls of the great estates. For when the cousins explored the musty recesses of their inherited homes, they discovered great underground laboratories left in startling disarray. Volumetric flasks lay shattered amongst the rusted remains of mechanical devices misshapen and strewn across the floor. And most disconcerting, the tattered remains of a most exceptional experiment. Oh the folly of the depressed and aged mind!
NewMaster_003=To those of lesser imagination, this may have been the death knell of their ambitions, but their youthful exuberance could not be shackled by the capricious whims of their progenitors! If their family could not continue the generations of hard work, they would create their own legacy!
NewMaster_004=Click to create a new Masterwork!

# passages/00137-MWCreationHubA.mws.yaml
MWCreationHubA_001=**{creationA}**
