# passages/00248-PetStore5.mws.yaml
PetStore5_001=Friendly Pet Store
PetStore5_002=Gain 2 Chemicals.

# passages/00249-3ExperimentsRes.mws.yaml
_3ExperimentsRes_001=As the years ambled onward and the peculiarities of their experimentations became more complex, it was not unheard of for the family to submit discoveries to scientific and medical journals. While most were summarily rejected, this constant stream of inquiries sometimes resulted in visits from interested parties.
_3ExperimentsRes_002=One such visitation occurred at the laboratory of {gen2exp}. While frightening to behold at first, they were intrigued by the exceedingly complex 
_3ExperimentsRes_003=display of colorful Chemicals and unique specimens collected (and created) over time.
_3ExperimentsRes_004=labyrinthine weaving of rubber tubing, chemicals, and simmering beakers of various shapes and sizes along the walls.
_3ExperimentsRes_005=vestibule filled with electrical coils, switches, dials, and several large metal cabinets with blinking red lights (a dazzling rarity in that age).
_3ExperimentsRes_006= Certainly immense strides forward had been made in {sci3}.
_3ExperimentsRes_007=It was only natural that they provided encouragement and financial resources to help preserve this unique arrangement. Especially after being informed that it was the only way they would leave the premises unaltered.
_3ExperimentsRes_008=**Retrieve the {sci3} Master's Study Vanity Estate Upgrade from the scenario box and add it to your Estate.** _You must still pay any required costs if you place it a new plot._

# passages/00250-PanaceaMessage.mws.yaml
PanaceaMessage_001=**Unintended Results**
PanaceaMessage_002=The dedication to the task was clear. My research unearthed several journals filled with line after line of a single mathematical formula, handwritten and repeated ad nauseam, followed by a chemical formula with slight alterations over time. The obsession literally spanned volumes and eventually paid large dividends.
PanaceaMessage_003=While technically the resulting solution did in fact "cure" all diseases, it also resulted in the death of the test subject, the liquification of their bones, dissolution of skin, and eventually five meters of solid ground in the affected area.
PanaceaMessage_004=A concoction such as this, despite its volatile nature, could offer legitimate scientific benefits upon publication. However, there were, of course, other options...
PanaceaMessage_005=**Do you wish to publish your findings or would you like unleash your creation on your rivals?**
PanaceaMessage_006=Publish my findings for fame.
PanaceaMessage_008=Unleash my creation!

# passages/00251-ImmortalityMWUpdate.mws.yaml
ImmortalityMWUpdate_001=**The True Secret**
ImmortalityMWUpdate_002=The family's pursuit of everlasting life brought new and inspirational concepts to the forefront. These ideas could verify the seemingly untenable Masterwork blueprints created by their Grandfather.
ImmortalityMWUpdate_003=Does any player have the **Immortality** Masterwork Experiment?

# passages/00252-ImmortalityMWUpdate2.mws.yaml
ImmortalityMWUpdate2_001=The Possibility Exists
ImmortalityMWUpdate2_002=The thoughts consumed their waking hours, compelling them to action. Surely if a form of **Immortality** can be so readily created by the family, then a more perfected version was just on the horizon. It would need to be done. It had to be done, or the shame they felt would weigh heavily on everything their exceptional lineage had created thus far.
ImmortalityMWUpdate2_003=Retrieve the **Immortality** Masterwork Update card from the Scenario box and give it to the player working towards this Masterwork.

