ENDNOTE_003=Check to make sure the player with **Immortality**completed their Masterwork. If they did not, they **lose 5VP.**
ENDNOTE_004=NOT SURE HOW TO CODE TIE-BREAKERS:
ENDNOTE_005=I can compare scores with a few lines, but it doesn't take into account tied scores.

