# passages/00255-SymposiumEvent2.mws.yaml
SymposiumEvent2_001=**For the Advancement of {sci3}**
SymposiumEvent2_002=The symposium began with a series of lectures from various noted 
SymposiumEvent2_003=engineers
SymposiumEvent2_004=biologists
SymposiumEvent2_005=chemists
SymposiumEvent2_006= from Eastern Europe. When it was their time to present, each cousin in turn rolled in a large cart covered with a velvet blanket to conceal their work until the appropriate moment during the lecture.
SymposiumEvent2_007=As noted by several critics, each family member went well over their allotted time, providing eye-opening live demonstrations during the peak of their lectures that required many in the first rows of the operating theater to change into a clean outfit after the end of the exhibition.
SymposiumEvent2_008=The spirited presentations stunned the community to abject silence.

# passages/00256-1sttime-Suspicion.mws.yaml
_1sttime_Suspicion_001=Place the Suspicion marker on space **{tracker}** and the {icon:angrymob_icon} token one space to the left.
_1sttime_Suspicion_002=**Suspicion Marker**
_1sttime_Suspicion_003=The Suspicion Marker represents the furthest right that the {icon:angrymob_icon} can move during a Generation. This marker stays in the same location throughout the current Generation and the {icon:angrymob_icon} token can never be moved **onto or past** this marker by any actions or abilities during gameplay.

