EvilWolves1Note_021=EVENT? I like Revenge for the player that's losing. They choose a player to have to fight.
EvilWolves1Note_022=Could rename Labor to Human Jail
EvilWolves1Note_023=Other ideas -
EvilWolves1Note_024=Creepy Meter alteration. Could just be way less emphasis on Creepiness even though they still have a limit.
EvilWolves1Note_025=Occult Experiments Encouraged - Most receives points.
EvilWolves1Note_026=EVIL HUNTERS -
