EvilWolves1Note_028=If Bank was built - Mayor Award
EvilWolves1Note_029=Chemistry Award
EvilWolves1Note_030=1st round Vote - call the Hunters out as fakes, challenge them to a contest.
EvilWolves1Note_031=- those accepting the cure are unable to plot against the Hunters cannot count their Experiments towards the Event.
EvilWolves1Note_032=2nd round Event - donate experiments and add up VP - Either minor reward or donation of Experiment to release into the wild.
EvilWolves1Note_033=Chemistry Award given to player
