# passages/00323-Huntround1.mws.yaml
Huntround1_002=As the full moon rose against a crimson sky, it was clear that the night of the Hunt had finally arrived. {h1a} III and {h1b} III were chosen. Naturally, the cousins declined to put themselves in potential harms way, so it was decided that they would send representatives in their stead to assist the Hunters.
Huntround1_003={h1a} III and {h1b} III each choose a Servant/Spouse piece and place it on the Hunter's Haven.

