FeverHeart2_001=Charity Awarded
FeverHeart2_002=The player with the most {icon:s1_hearttoken} tokens will keep **1** {icon:s1_hearttoken} in their Quarters and return all other tokens to the box. All other players return **all** of their {icon:s1_hearttoken} tokens to the box. _If there is a tie, the player_ **later in turn order** _this round receives the_ {icon:s1_hearttoken} _token._
FeverHeart2_003=The player with the {icon:s1_hearttoken} Token is:

